"[{\"id\":\"e4d0856\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"animation\":\"fadeIn\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c48a432\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d387e64\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-hero-meta\\\"><span class=\\\"sx-hero-eyebrow\\\">RS-485 Surge Protection Device</span><span class=\\\"sx-hero-sku\\\">SKU: SPD-T485-105</span></div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"5bccd9c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"RS-485 Surge Protector SPD-T485-105\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"title_color\":\"#3C7D47\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"15\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":true},\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"57292b7\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c39ffa8\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"52047da\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-section sx-industries sx-prod-apps\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-industries-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">Applications</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-industries-title\\\">Where SPD-T485-105 is deployed</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-chip-row\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Outdoor RS-485 Cables</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Lightning-Prone Sites</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Solar PV Farms</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Wind Farms</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Maritime Equipment</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Substation Telemetry</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Telecom Towers</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Oil &amp; Gas Field</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"cfb6020\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Certified Protection for High-Speed RS-485 Communication\",\"header_size\":\"div\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals/typography?id=secondary\",\"title_color\":\"globals/colors?id=accent\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"69edade\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://suriota.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/surge-protector-poster.webp\",\"id\":1730,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"9ad71a7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>When it comes to industrial communication networks, downtime from surge damage is not an option. The SPD-T485-105 RS-485 Surge Protector is the first in Indonesia certified to EN 61643-21, delivering world-class protection and performance you can trust.</p><p>Engineered for RS-485 systems operating up to 1 Mbps, it safeguards your data flow against lightning strikes, electrical surges, and electromagnetic interference, ensuring uninterrupted connectivity in even the harshest environments.</p><h3><strong>Certified Reliability</strong></h3><p>Compliant with:</p><ul><li><strong>EN 61643-21:2001+A1:2009+A2:2013</strong>. Surge protector performance &amp; testing requirements.</li><li><strong>EN IEC 61000-6-4:2019</strong> &amp; <strong>EN IEC 61000-6-2:2019</strong>. EMC compatibility and high immunity to electromagnetic interference.</li></ul><p><strong>Protect your network. Secure your data.</strong><br/>With the SPD-T485-105, you get certified, proven surge protection keeping your RS-485 communication stable, safe, and running at peak speed.</p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"a6020e9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-section sx-whyus sx-prod-features\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-whyus-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">KEY FEATURES</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-whyus-title\\\">Why engineers choose SPD-T485-105</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-whyus-grid\\\">\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">01</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">10kA Surge Discharge</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>10kA (8/20μs) nominal discharge current</strong> handles direct lightning-induced transients. 20kA peak capacity.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">02</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">&lt;25ns Response Time</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Sub-nanosecond clamp protects sensitive RS-485 transceivers <strong>before damaging energy reaches the line driver</strong>.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">03</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">IEC 61643-21 Certified</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Compliant with <strong>IEC 61643-21 Class III</strong> data line surge protection. Tested per IEEE C62.41 surge waveforms.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">04</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">DIN Rail Plug-and-Play</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>35mm DIN rail mountable</strong>, screw terminals for in/out, ground bonding terminal. Compact form for crowded panels.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">05</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Dual-Stage Protection</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>Two-step sequencing barrier</strong> preserves device lifespan and enhances surge suppression performance. Industry-leading design.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">06</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">High-Speed Data Compatible</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Low capacitive load supports RS-485 data rates <strong>up to 1 Mbps</strong>. Harsh environment coating per IEC 60950 for long-term stability.</p></article>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"05d342b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-action-group\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"sx-action-btn sx-action-btn--primary\\\" href=\\\"https://www.tokopedia.com/suriota\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" aria-label=\\\"Order SPD-T485-105 on Tokopedia\\\">\\n    <svg width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"9\\\" cy=\\\"21\\\" r=\\\"1\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"20\\\" cy=\\\"21\\\" r=\\\"1\\\"/><path d=\\\"M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6\\\"/></svg>\\n    <span>Order on Tokopedia</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-action-arrow\\\">→</span>\\n  </a>\\n  <a class=\\\"sx-action-btn sx-action-btn--secondary\\\" href=\\\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12XOl4YRrcpPVdAbYFFdjo-ylfev5Z-Lu?usp=sharing\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" aria-label=\\\"Download SPD-T485-105 datasheet\\\">\\n    <svg width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\\\"/><polyline points=\\\"14 2 14 8 20 8\\\"/><line x1=\\\"12\\\" y1=\\\"18\\\" x2=\\\"12\\\" y2=\\\"12\\\"/><polyline points=\\\"9 15 12 18 15 15\\\"/></svg>\\n    <span>Download Datasheet</span>\\n  </a>\\n</div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"d7fb90c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-faq\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-faq-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">FAQ</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-faq-title\\\">SPD-T485-105 | Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>What is the surge discharge capacity?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">10kA nominal (8/20μs waveform) and 20kA peak discharge current. Handles lightning-induced transients on outdoor RS-485 cables in solar farms, wind farms, maritime, and telecom tower applications.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>How fast does it respond to transients?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">Less than 25 nanoseconds clamp response time. Sub-nanosecond suppression protects sensitive RS-485 transceivers before damaging energy reaches the line driver IC. Typical RS-485 chips fail at ~10ns transients.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>Is it IEC-certified?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">Yes. Compliant with IEC 61643-21 Class III data line surge protection. Tested per IEEE C62.41 surge waveforms. Documentation available for engineering submittals and tender requirements.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>How is SPD-T485-105 installed?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">35mm DIN rail mountable, screw terminals for in/out connections, grounding bonding terminal. Compact form for crowded panels. Install in-line on the RS-485 cable run, close to the protected device.</div></details>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">\\n{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the surge discharge capacity?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"10kA nominal (8/20μs) and 20kA peak discharge current. Handles lightning-induced transients on outdoor RS-485 cables.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How fast does it respond?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Less than 25ns clamp response time. Protects sensitive RS-485 transceivers before damaging energy reaches the line driver.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Is it IEC certified?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. IEC 61643-21 Class III data line surge protection. Tested per IEEE C62.41.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How is it installed?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"35mm DIN rail mount, screw terminals, ground bonding terminal. Install in-line close to protected device.\\\"}}\\n]}\\n</script>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"0583b05\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-cta-final\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"prod-cta-heading\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-cta-final-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-cta-eyebrow\\\">Get Started</span>\\n    <h2 id=\\\"prod-cta-heading\\\" class=\\\"sx-cta-final-title\\\">Ready to protect your RS-485 communications?</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"sx-cta-final-sub\\\">Request a quote with site survey. Our engineers recommend SPD topology and grounding scheme for your specific cable runs within 24 hours.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-cta-final-actions\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"sx-cta-final-btn sx-cta-final-btn--primary\\\" href=\\\"https://suriota.com/contact/\\\">Request Quote <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">→</span></a>\\n      <a class=\\\"sx-cta-final-btn sx-cta-final-btn--wa\\\" href=\\\"https://wa.me/6285835672476?text=Hi%20SURIOTA%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20SPD-T485-105\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" aria-label=\\\"Chat on WhatsApp\\\">\\n        <svg width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.65